---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — A3S Labs" description="A3S Labs is an independent software and applied intelligence lab building products across data, infrastructure, education and simulation.">
  <section class="page-hero section-pad">
    <div class="shell page-hero-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span>ABOUT</span><span>A3S / 04</span></p>
      <div><h1>An independent product and applied-intelligence lab.</h1><p>A3S Labs is built around shipping systems, learning from them and turning that work into stronger software across different domains.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad section-rule">
    <div class="shell about-grid">
      <div><p class="section-kicker">Position</p><h2>Not a catalogue of services.</h2></div>
      <div class="about-copy"><p>The lab spans product engineering, data science, applied machine learning, infrastructure and research. Individual projects can look very different on the surface, but the common thread is systems thinking: ingest the right signal, model it carefully, expose useful behavior, and operate the result reliably.</p><p>The public portfolio is intentionally anchored to repositories and live systems rather than invented client counts, fictional team biographies or generic testimonial copy.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad capability-band">
    <div class="shell timeline">
      <p class="section-kicker">Trajectory</p>
      <div class="timeline-grid">
        <article><span>FOUNDATIONS</span><h3>Web, mobile and backend systems</h3><p>Framework experimentation, APIs, school systems, SaaS patterns and application architecture.</p></article>
        <article><span>DATA</span><h3>Analysis, ML and pipelines</h3><p>Exploratory analysis, scraping, prediction, computer vision, NLP and structured data workflows.</p></article>
        <article><span>PRODUCTS</span><h3>Integrated production systems</h3><p>Products such as The Torque, iStatus, ShuleYangu and RotorFrontier combine multiple disciplines into complete experiences.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad section-rule">
    <div class="shell contact-panel">
      <p class="section-kicker">Source of truth</p>
      <h2>The repositories tell the story best.</h2>
      <p>Inspect the code, architecture notes and active product work directly.</p>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/simlexx-k" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub profile <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
